Keeps this directory in git.

ASP.NET's static web assets loader resolves WebRootPath at start-up and throws
DirectoryNotFoundException if wwwroot is missing. Git does not track empty
directories, so when the last uploaded image was removed from here the folder
disappeared from a fresh clone and the app would not start.

Medicine images now live in the database (see MedicineImage), so nothing is
written here any more - but the directory still has to exist.
